usage: verify_report.py [-h]

Recompute corridor physics, learning targets and cue gates with stdlib only.

optional arguments:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit

Checks the saved reports beside this script. No arguments are required; an
invalid report exits with an assertion failure.
usage: check_delivery.py [-h]

Check the bounded horizon evidence and unchanged historical inputs.

optional arguments:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit

Run from any directory after verification.json is saved. No arguments are
required; mismatched evidence exits with an assertion failure.
